    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## MiniMax H3 · first / last frame\n\nThe **Director** draws the move, **Guide Frames** carries your first frame to where the camera ends, and **Fill Reveal (AI)** paints the area the camera uncovers with an image model. **H3 Shot** hands H3 the first frame, that last frame, the length (17k+5), the size and a prompt with the camera move and the Director's **look**.\n\n- **Look** (on the Director): cinematic, deforum_morph, animatediff_dream, stop_motion...\n- Fill model: an inpaint checkpoint (SDXL inpainting, Flux Fill) gives the cleanest seams; bypass Fill Reveal (Ctrl+B) for moves that stay inside the frame.\n- H3 files follow the official templates. Turbo LoRA: Ctrl+B, steps 6-8."
   ]
  }
